5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to learn how we work together. I think I will look into the staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I am interested in the network coverage at customer plants and the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I believe we must be prudent about the finances. I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make this interesting! I'm curious about the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello. I think it's important to see what's actually happening on the floor. I'll look into misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, do you think the budget is very tight this year? I hope we can find a project that makes everyone happy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe a calm approach to the data will guide us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,It is always tight if you do not look closely at the source. We must be careful.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, George, you're always so serious! Let's see what the data actually tells us first.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with May. I hope we can find a solution that helps the people doing the daily work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Midori. I wonder if the people working on these projects feel tired.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,That is a valid concern. Peace of mind is essential for quality work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"Experience tells me that enthusiasm is good, but sustainability is better.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Sustainability is just a fancy word for ""not failing,"" right? I want to see if we're just repeating old mistakes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I just want to make sure we aren't overlooking the small, repetitive problems that add up over time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I think I have decided on my choices. I'm looking forward to learning more.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am as well. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,Very well. I shall stick to my plan.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready! Let's see who has the best luck with their findings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to contribute.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
